   "options": "<div style=\"background:var(--yellow-50,#FFF4D0);border:1.5px dashed #DDA800;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px\"><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;background:#FFC21A;color:#2B2100;padding:2px 9px;border-radius:999px\">Upon work completion</span><p style=\"margin:10px 0 0;color:#2B2100\">I declare that, on completion or non-completion of the work, I have checked the work area thoroughly. The affected area is completely clean and production can safely restart here. This permit is cancelled.</p></div>"
